# Event$ GainLife | ValidSource$ SpellAbility | SourceController$ True |
# ReplaceWith$ RLoseLife: "If a spell or ability would cause its controller to
# gain life, that player loses that much life instead." Rain of Gore is the
# opponent's; human's Nourish would gain 6 for its own controller, so human
# loses 6 (ReplaceGainLife.canReplace reads the causing SpellAbility).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
castspell human 1
resolvestack
